pastwrite(4,3,'email','HCL vacancy enquiry', '''Subject: Enquiry about HCL openings and referral process

Dear Alex Kumar,

We met at the recent job fair and exchanged contact details while discussing opportunities in software development. I am writing because our mutual friend mentioned that HCL may have openings relevant to my Computer Science background.

Could you please share the job description, eligibility requirements and application procedure for any suitable position? Information about the location and selection stages would also help me assess the opportunity. I would be happy to send my CV and project details for your review.

If you consider my profile suitable and the company permits employee referrals, I would be grateful for your guidance or a referral. I understand that this depends on your assessment and the organisation’s process.

Thank you for your time and assistance. I appreciate the advice you shared at the fair and look forward to hearing from you.

Kind regards,
Riya Sen''')
